---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GhlFormEmbed from '../components/GhlFormEmbed.astro';
import Badge from '../components/Badge.astro';
---
<Layout title="Diensten — BDigital" description="Creatie, marketing en automatisering die op elkaar aansluiten. Ontdek de diensten van BDigital en hoe ze samen jouw online groei versnellen." page="diensten">
<section data-screen-label="01 Hero diensten" style="background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) clamp(20px,4vw,48px) clamp(56px,8vw,110px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(40px,5vw,72px);align-items:center">
    <div style="flex:1 1 460px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px">
      <span style="align-self:flex-start;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 14px;border:1.5px solid #C5FF27;color:#C5FF27;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap"><span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#C5FF27"></span>Onze diensten</span>
      <h1 lang="nl" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(44px,6.4vw,92px);line-height:.94;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-transform:uppercase;text-wrap:balance">Alles om je merk <span style="color:#C5FF27">vooruit te brengen.</span></h1>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#C9C9C2;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:18px;max-width:560px">Een sterk merk moet er goed uitzien, de juiste mensen bereiken en achter de schermen soepel werken. Daarom brengen we creatie, marketing en automatisering samen onder één dak.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#9E9E97;max-width:520px">Van een nieuwe merkidentiteit tot campagnes die klanten opleveren en slimme systemen die werk uit handen nemen.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center"><a class="h0" href="#intake" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#C5FF27;color:#0B0B0B;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:16px 24px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Plan een kennismaking <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a><a class="h1" href="#creatie" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #4A4A4A;white-space:nowrap;transition:border-color .2s">Bekijk onze diensten</a></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 380px;min-width:0;position:relative;height:clamp(460px,44vw,540px)">
      <div style="position:absolute;right:2%;top:8%;width:62%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px dashed #3A3A3A"></div>
      <a class="h10" href="#creatie" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;transform:rotate(-5deg);width:min(78%,340px);background:#FFB8D9;color:#0B0B0B;border-radius:20px;padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transition:transform .25s"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l4.5-1L19 8.5 15.5 5 5 15.5z"></path><path d="M13.5 7l3.5 3.5"></path></svg><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em">01</span></div><span style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1">Creatie</span><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px"><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Branding</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Websites</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Content</span></div><span style="flex:none;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></div></a>
      <a class="h10" href="#marketing" style="position:absolute;top:31%;left:22%;transform:rotate(3deg);width:min(78%,340px);background:#C5FF27;color:#0B0B0B;border-radius:20px;padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transition:transform .25s"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10v4h3l6 4V6L7 10z"></path><path d="M16.5 9a4 4 0 0 1 0 6"></path><path d="M19 6.5a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 0 11"></path></svg><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em">02</span></div><span style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1">Marketing</span><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px"><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Campagnes</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">SEO</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Leadgeneratie</span></div><span style="flex:none;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></div></a>
      <a class="h10" href="#automatisering" style="position:absolute;top:62%;left:6%;transform:rotate(-2deg);width:min(78%,340px);background:#CBB8FF;color:#0B0B0B;border-radius:20px;padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transition:transform .25s"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.6-5.9L20 8.5"></path><path d="M20 3.5v5h-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em">03</span></div><span style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1">Automatisering</span><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px"><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Workflows</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">CRM</span><span style="padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">Dashboards</span></div><span style="flex:none;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></div></a>
      <span style="position:absolute;right:0;bottom:4%;background:#fff;color:#0B0B0B;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);white-space:nowrap">Onder één dak</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section data-screen-label="02 Introductie" style="background:#F4F1EA;padding:clamp(64px,9vw,120px) 0 clamp(40px,5vw,64px)">
  <div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,48px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,72px);align-items:flex-start">
    <div style="flex:1 1 420px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#CBB8FF;color:#0B0B0B;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;">Waar sta je nu?</span><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-wrap:balance;">Waar kunnen we je bij <span style="background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%, #C5FF27 58%, #C5FF27 94%, transparent 94%);padding:0 .08em;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone">helpen?</span></h2></div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 420px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">Sommige bedrijven zoeken een nieuwe uitstraling. Andere willen meer bereik, betere leads of minder handmatig werk. Vaak ligt de beste oplossing in een combinatie daarvan.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">We kijken naar wat je bedrijf nu nodig heeft en bouwen van daaruit verder.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:6px">
        <a class="h0" href="#creatie" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFB8D9;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Een nieuwe uitstraling →</a>
        <a class="h0" href="#marketing" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#C5FF27;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Meer bereik en leads →</a>
        <a class="h0" href="#automatisering" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#CBB8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Minder handmatig werk →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="creatie" data-screen-label="03 Creatie" style="background:#F4F1EA;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,110px) 0;scroll-margin-top:70px">
  <div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,48px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(36px,5vw,80px);align-items:center">
      <div style="flex:1 1 440px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;background:#FFB8D9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l4.5-1L19 8.5 15.5 5 5 15.5z"></path><path d="M13.5 7l3.5 3.5"></path></svg></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;align-self:center">Creatie</span></div>
        <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-wrap:balance;">Een merk dat klopt en <span style="background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%, #FFB8D9 58%, #FFB8D9 94%, transparent 94%);padding:0 .08em;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone">herkenbaar blijft.</span></h2>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">Je uitstraling bepaalt hoe mensen je bedrijf zien. We vertalen jouw verhaal naar een heldere identiteit en middelen die professioneel, herkenbaar en consistent aanvoelen.</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">Of je nu een nieuw merk begint, je huidige uitstraling wilt vernieuwen of een website nodig hebt die beter bij je bedrijf past.</p>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:700"><span style="flex:none;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff">Voor wie</span>Voor merken die duidelijker willen laten zien wie ze zijn en waarom klanten voor hen moeten kiezen.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:6px"><a class="h0" href="#creatie" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Ontdek Creatie <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="h11" style="flex:1 1 400px;min-width:0;background:#FFB8D9;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .25s">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;right:-10px;top:-34px;font-size:180px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;color:rgba(11,11,11,.08)">01</span>
        <h3 style="margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;position:relative">Waar we je bij helpen</h3>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:4px 20px;position:relative">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Merkstrategie en positionering</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Branding en visuele identiteit</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Websites en landingspagina’s</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Grafisch ontwerp</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Content en copywriting</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Campagneconcepten</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,.14);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35"><span style="flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0B0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg></span>Socialmediacontent</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="marketing" data-screen-label="04 Marketing" style="background:#FFFFFF;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,110px) 0;scroll-margin-top:70px">
  <div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,48px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap-reverse;gap:clamp(36px,5vw,80px);align-items:center">
      <div style="flex:1 1 440px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;background:#C5FF27;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10v4h3l6 4V6L7 10z"></path><path d="M16.5 9a4 4 0 0 1 0 6"></path><path d="M19 6.5a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 0 11"></path></svg></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;align-self:center">Marketing</span></div>
        <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-wrap:balance;">Zichtbaar worden bij de mensen die <span style="background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%, #C5FF27 58%, #C5FF27 94%, transparent 94%);padding:0 .08em;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone">ertoe doen.</span></h2>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">Goede marketing begint niet bij zoveel mogelijk bereik, maar bij een duidelijk plan. Wie wil je bereiken? Wat wil je vertellen? En welke actie moet daarop volgen?</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#3E3D39;text-wrap:pretty;">We ontwikkelen marketing die past bij je merk, doelgroep en groeidoelen. Vervolgens meten we wat werkt en sturen we bij waar dat nodig is.</p>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:700"><span style="flex:none;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff">Voor wie</span>Voor bedrijven die hun zichtbaarheid willen omzetten in concrete aanvragen, klanten en groei.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:6px"><a class="h0" href="#marketing" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#0B0B0B;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .2s">Ontdek Marketing <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C5FF27" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="h11" style="flex:1 1 400px;min-width:0;background:#C5FF27;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .25s">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;right:-10px;top:-34px;font-size:180px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;color:rgba(11,11,11,.08)">02</span>
